5. REVENUE DAX MEASURES SPECIFICATION
A dedicated, isolated directory table (_Measures) was initiated to house business logic. The foundational revenue calculations utilize vertical column aggregations over the pre-calculated source data:
1. Gross Revenue Metric
Gross Revenue = SUM('sales_orders_line'[Line Total])
Description: Sums baseline transaction values across all rows before adjustments.
2. Total Net Revenue Metric
Total Net Revenue = SUM('sales_orders_line'[Line Grand Total])
Description: Summarizes final adjusted revenue invoiced to customers, forming the baseline for top-line corporate profitability tracking.
